      "no": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Jas’s magic was tied to living things—the revival of stem and root and petal, like the begonia he had brought back to li",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3112
        }
      ],
      "words": 42
    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“There’s a rare phenomenon that happens in Mortri when two spirits merge. Namely, when one soul stitches itself to anoth",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3832
        }
      ],
      "words": 27
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Certain souls, certain powers, are incompatible, and cause excruciating pain the longer they’re joined. Some forgot who ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5178
        }
      ],
      "words": 37
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "That’s a rare combination. A powerful one. Certainly powerful enough to deny your body a well-deserved death",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5647
        }
      ],
      "words": 17
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "She lied so boldly that Jas was stunned to silence. “And all of Mortri to oversee.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7414
        }
      ],
      "words": 16
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "In fact, if she focused, she could see the baby’s feeble tether. The gossamer string was entwined with that of its mothe",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15016
        }
      ],
      "words": 26
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The world is maybe breaking, but there is good here. I do not need to break with it.” Her gaze dropped to her stomach",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15991
        }
      ],
      "words": 24
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The world was breaking, and maybe so was she—but there was a potential for new growth in the cracks",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 16517
        }
      ],
      "words": 19
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Because of me, your realm was attacked. Because of me, so many are dead",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 19754
        }
      ],
      "words": 14
    },
    {
      "block": "原句10",
      "no": 10,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Death in either direction, and you unluckily in the middle. This is what it means to be a Deviser—to save, and to be use",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 22479
        }
      ],
      "words": 24
    },
    {
      "block": "原句11",
      "no": 11,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "It’s not ore,” Risha said, quietly killing the conversation heating up around her. “Or mineral. It’s bone",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 25958
        }
      ],
      "words": 17
    },
    {
      "block": "原句12",
      "no": 12,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Physical and spiritual. This bone may be the physical component of whatever had once carried Phos’s fulcrum, just like h",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 26454
        }
      ],
      "words": 25
    },
    {
      "block": "原句13",
      "no": 13,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“It’ll be my absolute pleasure.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 28185
        }
      ],
      "words": 5
    }
